          {
           "type": "heading",
           "level": 2,
           "html": "Shuijing",
           "align": "center",
           "size": null
          },
          {
           "type": "paragraph",
           "html": "<strong>Shuijing</strong>’s preference for scenes of Ukiyo-e and Song Dynasty artists encapsulates their contemplative approach to life beneath the icy surface of Enceladus. These artistic traditions emphasize harmony and natural beauty, which parallel Shuijing’s efforts to balance the alien ecosystems within Enceladus’s subglacial oceans. In the Imaginarium, Shuijing crafts a world where water flows in endless cycles, reflecting the fluidity and impermanence of life, resonating deeply with their own experiences and observations of the hidden life forms on their moon.",
           "align": null,
           "size": null
          },
          {
           "type": "paragraph",
           "html": "The artists that are part of this collection include, among others, Hokusai, Utagawa Kuniyoshi, Hasui Kawase and Utagawa Hiroshige for Ukiyo-e, <a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?client=safari&amp;sca_esv=10624941311519dc&amp;sca_upv=1&amp;cs=0&amp;q=Wang+Ximeng&amp;stick=H4sIAAAAAAAAAONgVeLSz9U3MDOtSssyNBIpzs9LV0ipzEssLqlUSCwqySwuKT7FyAlSYlSem2F5ihGs3DipKj3NGMoxKsw2sjSCciAGQbWYGVem50LZFklZ6aZQRSYp8WaWZjCzcjPM0wuhqoyzytKToRKmVZUlRWYw7eYl6ZZQtml2UUU5lG1SYJhUAGPn5sXD1BiWW8bnwNjFZcZpMCeZlZdYwNxabpxjZAKzwLTSAOYJI_Mkc3OYX03SjNPTYIFgbGBhWfCI8Skjt8DLH_eEpW4zTlpz8hrjFUYuAZ_8_OLUnMqg1JzEktSUkHwhMS4217ySzJJKIR4pLi4OkPa0gjJTIXcu7uDUkpB83_yUzLRKIQshMy5O39TcpNSiYv80IVUuLuf8nJzU5JLM_DwhcSlRLmH9ZLiAPjROrJg0mJRijdx2XZp2js1BkAEI9OKDHaQ0tAS52FzycxMz8wSvcx1ZoHXynb2WMBdHSGJFfl5-bqWgweV_8_f8eW-vxMkJ1HPAoQkozzCBibFp34pDbDwcjAIMRmwcDEJMTMxVDDyLWLnDE4EJIiIzNzUvfQIbIwBJ2GssLwIAAA&amp;sa=X&amp;ved=2ahUKEwjvo9PH-OeFAxUaC0QIHUwBDC4Q7fAIegUIABD2AQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Wang Ximeng</a>, Li Cheng and Fan Kuan for Song Dynasty.",
           "align": null,
           "size": null
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
