          {
           "type": "heading",
           "level": 2,
           "html": "Kweku",
           "align": "center",
           "size": null
          },
          {
           "type": "paragraph",
           "html": "<strong>Kweku</strong>’s affinity for intricate patterns reflects their analytical and playful nature, finding joy in the complex interconnections of life’s underlying structures. Their passion spans across cultures, from the geometric precision of Islamic tiles to the mind-bending optical illusions of M.C. Escher and the vibrant dynamism of Victor Vasarely. These patterns are not just aesthetic choices but represent the fundamental laws of nature and mathematics that Kweku manipulates within the Martian lava tubes, guiding them in their quest to map and understand Mars' hidden landscapes.",
           "align": null,
           "size": null
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
